  "pdp": {
    "page_title": "Domed Gold Vinyl Sticker Sheet",
    "meta_description": "Custom Gold Domed Stickers with 3D resin-coated, scratch-resistant & water-resistant. Perfect for premium branding, product labels & promotional items.",
    "reviews_count": 0,
    "images": [
      {
        "zoom": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/1184/Image-Amazon-Domed---02Gold__53248.1778499553.1280.1280.jpg?c=1",
        "standard": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/1184/Image-Amazon-Domed---02Gold__53248.1778499553.386.513.jpg?c=1",
        "thumb": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/1184/Image-Amazon-Domed---02Gold__53248.1778499553.220.290.jpg?c=1",
        "alt": "Domed Gold Vinyl Sticker Sheet"
      },
      {
        "zoom": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/801/ProductionImage__35935.1778499553.1280.1280.png?c=1",
        "standard": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/801/ProductionImage__35935.1778499553.386.513.png?c=1",
        "thumb": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-idicuo6kuq/products/183/images/801/ProductionImage__35935.1778499553.220.290.png?c=1",
        "alt": "Domed Gold Vinyl Sticker Sheet"
      }
    ],
    "description_html": "<!-- Notice -->\n<p>Digitally printed Domed Vinyl Stickers have a scratch-resistant epoxy resin coating to protect your company logo or design. Perfect for indoor product branding!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full color, high resolution digital printing</li>\n<li>Epoxy Resin Gel Stickers</li>\n<li>Durable polyurethane resin coating</li>\n<li>Strong adhesion</li>\n<li>Water-resistant</li>\n<li>No setup or design fees</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Our Domed Stickers are supplied in sheet format, not on a roll or individually cut.</p>\n<p>Domed Stickers (also referred to by some as Domed Labels, Domed Badges, 3D Stickers or 3D Resin Badges, Gel Stickers, Epoxy Stickers) are a popular form of product labeling and brand identity used by a growing number of industries.</p>\n<p>The polyurethane resin dome provides a hard-wearing, scratch-resistant coating to protect your company logo or design, displaying it clearly, even in harsh conditions. Domed Stickers are a great addition to any product that will display your company logo or brand clearly and professionally.</p>\n<p>Watch your design magically pop with Custom Genie Domed Stickers! Captivate your audience with a 3D resin coating that gives your custom stickers eye-catching dimension. Choose from Gloss White, Brushed Silver, or Brushed Gold vinyl to match your style. Built to resist scratches, water, and wear, these personalized stickers ensure your designs stand out from the rest. With high-resolution CMYK printing and Pantone&reg; matching, your logo or message stays true to your brand. Elevate your brand&rsquo;s presence instantly and use your stickers for branding electronics, appliances, promotional items, and product packaging. Whether you&rsquo;re labeling products or handing out swag at trade shows, these domed stickers help your business stick in style&mdash;no setup fees required.</p>\n<p>Rub the lamp of branding possibilities and watch as Custom Genie's magical domed stickers bring your designs to life! Featuring vibrant, high-resolution printing and a protective polyurethane dome, these stickers add a sleek 3D effect that&rsquo;s both eye-catching and built to last. The scratch-resistant epoxy coating not only adds depth and shine but also protects your design from wear, water, and fading, making them perfect for high-touch surfaces and long-term use.</p>\n<p>Summon your perfect finish from three vibrant vinyl options: high-gloss white for bold color impact, brushed silver for a sleek metallic edge, or brushed gold for a luxe, elevated look. Each sticker is backed with a strong adhesive enchantment to ensure it stays put on electronics, packaging, product displays, and more. Whatever size you wish for&mdash;from 0.5 inches to nearly 9 inches wide&mdash;allows for full customization to fit any surface or branding application.</p>\n<p>These domed stickers are an excellent choice for a wide range of industries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Electronics and appliances:</strong> Add a branded nameplate that won&rsquo;t peel or fade.</li>\n<li><strong>Promotional products:</strong> Hand out custom logo stickers with a high-end finish.</li>\n<li><strong>Manufacturing:</strong> Durable enough for machinery or equipment tags.</li>\n<li><strong>Event marketing:</strong> Give your brand a premium look at trade shows or expos.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With no setup fees, Pantone&reg; color matching, and low minimums, Custom Genie makes it easy to order domed stickers that reflect your brand at its best. Durable, professional, and made to impress.</p>\n<!-- Technical Information -->\n<h3><span>Technical Information</span></h3>\n<p><strong>Polyurethane Doming Resin</strong><br />Our domed stickers are coated with a scratch-proof polyurethane epoxy resin. Not only is the plastic coating scratch-proof, but it also protects the sticker from the sun's harmful UV rays. This protection helps to keep your logo looking bright and fade-free, preserving each of your design's vibrant colors for years of faithful service.</p>\n<p><strong>Printing</strong><br />We digitally print using a high resolution 4 color (CMYK) process to print all logos, text and background colors onto the stickers. We can print onto White, Brushed Silver, Brushed Gold, Chrome Silver and Chrome Gold vinyl substrates. When printing your design onto any of the vinyls other than white, the white sections of your design will become clear, which (in the case of the metallic vinyls) will show through the metallic effect of the vinyl itself.</p>\n<p><strong>Pantone&reg; Colors</strong><br />If Pantone&reg; colors are used in your design we will use the CMYK Pantone&reg; matching system to print your stickers using CMYK inks. Please note: There are many Pantone&reg; colors that cannot be accurately matched using CMYK colors. If you use a Pantone&reg; color that cannot be matched it will be converted to the closest CMYK color available. If printing on a vinyl other than white, the color or effect of the vinyl may affect the final printed color.</p>\n<p><strong>Please Note</strong><br />For custom shape designs ordered we may have to alter your design if it is not feasible to be domed, such as if it contains pointed edges or tight internal radiuses. Corners must be rounded and need to have a minimum radius of around 1mm. Please contact us to discuss your requirements. All email orders will be given a PDF proof before production which will show any of these changes. Orders placed on the website will be approved as part of the ordering process.</p>\n<!-- Materials -->\n<h3><span>Materials</span></h3>\n<p><strong>Domed Gloss White Vinyl</strong><br />Shiny finish gloss white material.</p>\n<p><strong>Domed Brushed Silver Vinyl</strong><br />Metallic silver material with a brushed effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Domed Brushed Gold Vinyl</strong><br />Metallic gold material with a brushed effect.</p>\n<!-- FAQs -->\n<h3><span>Product FAQs</span></h3>\n<p><strong>How are the domed stickers supplied?</strong><br />All of our custom stickers are supplied in an easy-to-peel sheet format. The sheets are 9.25 inches wide by 10 inches tall with a printable area for the location of the stickers which is 8.81 inches x 8.64 inches. They are not available on a roll or individually cut.</p>\n<p><strong>Do you offer metallic background options?</strong><br />For domed stickers we offer a brushed silver and brush gold metallic vinyl as well as a white vinyl. Vinyl is the name given to the sticker material that we print your design onto. Each vinyl type has its own unique properties. For more information on the different vinyls, please see the 'Metallic Options' tab above.</p>\n<p><strong>Is the doming resin scratch-proof?</strong><br />All of our domed stickers are domed with a scratch-resistant epoxy resin. Not only is the resin coating scratch-proof, but it also provides a high quality look to all of your stickers.</p>\n<p><strong>How thick is your domed resin coating?</strong><br />Our domed resin coating is usually around 0.06 inches thick. However, due to tolerances in the production process, the thickness may vary by +/- 0.03 inches.</p>\n<p><strong>What is the minimum and maximum size for a domed sticker?</strong><br />Minimum size: 0.5 x 0.5 inches<br />Maximum size: 8.81 x 8.64 inches<br />Corner Radius: Required (minimum 0.04 in)</p>\n<p><strong>What shapes can I choose from?</strong><br /><span data-teams=\"true\">Our domed stickers are available in almost any shape you can think of. On our website you can choose from: Rectangle, Square, Circle, Stadium and Oval.</span></p>"
  },
